  "description": "The temple of the god Lugalbanda, Esag (\u201cForemost House\u201d), was located in the Kullab district of Babylon, in the eastern half of the inner city. According to the Babylonian topographical text Tintir = Babylon Tablet IV, it was one of four temples in that part of Babylon.",
